{"unit_id":"hu568__dsh-plugin-persona-memory#feature-1","repo":"hu568/dsh-plugin-persona-memory","commit":"1a50ea8ed81acf668efe7966727a55cbc94daf1f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Persona Memory 的功能「角色提示词」：插件注册角色与记忆提示词段落，使当前角色设定和记忆可用于 agent 会话。通过宿主 systemPrompt 段落触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:126-166"]}
